---
/** @fileoverview Illustrates connecting a coding agent to the project's rules through an AGENTS.md instruction card and a static task prompt. */
---
<figure class="application" aria-label="Example agent setup with project instructions">
  <div class="setup-heading"><span class="agent-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳︎</span><span>Your coding agent</span><span class="setup-label">PROJECT SETUP</span></div>
  <div class="setup-body">
    <p class="instructions-label">GIVE YOUR AGENT PROJECT INSTRUCTIONS</p>
    <div class="instruction-file">
      <div class="file-heading"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z" /><path d="M14 2v6h6" /></svg><span>AGENTS.md</span></div>
      <div class="instructions">
        <p><strong>Use this project’s engineering rules.</strong></p>
        <p>Before writing or reviewing code, read<br /><code>.code-rules/generated/RULES.md</code></p>
        <p>Follow its instructions to select and read the rules that apply to your task.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="task-prompt"><span>What would you like to build?</span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 19V5m-6 6 6-6 6 6" /></svg></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Example setup. Use your coding agent’s project instruction file.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .application { min-width: 0; margin: 0; border: 1px solid var(--cr-line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--cr-paper); color: var(--cr-ink); --setup-purple: #c4a1e8; --setup-blue: #8bbbe7; }
  :global([data-theme='light']) .application { --setup-purple: #7850ae; --setup-blue: #216bb0; }
  .setup-heading { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cr-line); background: var(--cr-surface); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .agent-icon { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--setup-purple); }
  .setup-label { margin-left: auto; color: var(--cr-muted); font-size: .55rem; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .setup-body { padding: 1.4rem; }
  .instructions-label { margin: 0 0 .8rem; color: var(--cr-muted); font-size: .6rem; line-height: 1.6; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .instruction-file { border: 1px solid var(--cr-line); border-radius: 9px; overflow: hidden; }
  .file-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; padding: .65rem .9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cr-line); background: var(--cr-surface); color: var(--cr-ink); font: .75rem/1.6 var(--cr-font-mono); }
  .file-heading svg { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--cr-muted); }
  .instructions { padding: 1rem; }
  .instructions p { margin: 0 0 .75rem; color: var(--cr-ink); font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .instructions p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  strong { font-weight: 600; }
  code { padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; color: var(--setup-blue); font: .75rem/1.6 var(--cr-font-mono); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .connector { display: grid; place-items: center; height: 2rem; color: var(--cr-muted); }
  .task-prompt { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--cr-line); border-radius: 8px; padding: .9rem; color: var(--cr-muted); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .task-prompt svg { flex-shrink: 0; }
  figcaption { padding: 0 1.4rem 1.2rem; color: var(--cr-muted); font-size: .65rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 440px) { .setup-heading { padding: 1rem; } .setup-body { padding: 1rem; } .instructions { padding: .85rem; } figcaption { padding-inline: 1rem; } }
</style>
